tatus":"unresolved","note":"群體、合稱或待辨稱名；和親條件及建議中的未來子孫不當實際人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0293","start":293,"end":295,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"khs_72e_51r-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0303","start":303,"end":306,"surface":"長公主","kind":"person","person_id":"mmb_3md_ti2-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0307","start":307,"end":309,"surface":"呂后","kind":"person","person_id":"kgm_9od_w45-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0318","start":318,"end":320,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"sxh_xrd_qlt-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0321","start":321,"end":323,"surface":"一女","kind":"person","person_id":"mmb_3md_ti2-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0337","start":337,"end":340,"surface":"長公主","kind":"person","person_id":"mmb_3md_ti2-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0343","start":343,"end":346,"surface":"家人子","kind":"person","person_id":"g7g_fpv_oq5-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0348","start":348,"end":351,"surface":"長公主","kind":"person","person_id":"g7g_fpv_oq5-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m006-0357","start":357,"end":359,"surface":"劉敬","kind":"person","person_id":"yv1_5v4_pjs-","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-099-liushu","book_id":"b-shiji-099","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-099-liushu"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:p007","text":"劉敬從匈奴來，因言「匈奴河南白羊、樓煩王，去長安近者七百里，輕騎一日一夜可以至秦中。秦中新破，少民，地肥饒，可益實。夫諸侯初起時，非齊諸田，楚昭、屈、景莫能興。今陛下雖都關中，實少人。北近胡寇，東有六國之族，宗彊，一日有變，陛下亦未得高枕而臥也。臣願陛下徙齊諸田，楚昭、屈、景，燕、趙、韓、魏後，及豪桀名家居關中。無事，可以備胡；諸侯有變，亦足率以東伐。此彊本弱末之術也」。上曰：「善。」乃使劉敬徙所言關中十餘萬口。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m007-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"劉敬","kind":"person","person_id":"yv1_5v4_pjs-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m007-0014","start":14,"end":20,"surface":"白羊、樓煩王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、合稱或待辨稱名；和親條件及建議中的未來子孫不當實際人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m007-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface":"齊諸田","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、合稱或待辨稱名；和親條件及建議中的未來子孫不當實際人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m007-0070","start":70,"end":76,"surface":"楚昭、屈、景","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、合稱或待辨稱名；和親條件及建議中的未來子孫不當實際人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m007-0128","start":128,"end":131,"surface":"齊諸田","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、合稱或待辨稱名；和親條件及建議中的未來子孫不當實際人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m007-0132","start":132,"end":138,"surface":"楚昭、屈、景","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、合稱或待辨稱名；和親條件及建議中的未來子孫不當實際人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m007-0139","start":139,"end":147,"surface":"燕、趙、韓、魏後","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、合稱或待辨稱名；和親條件及建議中的未來子孫不當實際人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m007-0196","start":196,"end":198,"surface":"劉敬","kind":"person","person_id":"yv1_5v4_pjs-","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-099-liushu","book_id":"b-shiji-099","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-099-liushu"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:p020","text":"太史公曰：語曰「千金之裘，非一狐之腋也；臺榭之榱，非一木之枝也；三代之際，非一士之智也。」信哉！夫高祖起微細，定海內，謀計用兵，可謂盡之矣。然而劉敬脫輓輅一說，建萬世之安，智豈可專邪！叔孫通希世度務，制禮進退，與時變化，卒為漢家儒宗。「大直若詘，道固委蛇」，蓋謂是乎？","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m020-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"lfr_3b7_zf5-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m020-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"khs_72e_51r-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m020-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":